@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title SCM Platform - Use Case (Admin, Security, Observability)

actor "System Admin" as Admin
actor "DevOps Engineer" as DevOps

rectangle "Platform Management" {
  usecase "Manage Users and Roles" as UC_Users
  usecase "Configure API Routes" as UC_Routes
  usecase "View Service Registry" as UC_Discovery
  usecase "Monitor Metrics Dashboard" as UC_Metrics
  usecase "Review Kafka Lag and DLT" as UC_Kafka
  usecase "Audit Auth Events" as UC_Audit
}

Admin --> UC_Users
Admin --> UC_Routes
Admin --> UC_Discovery
Admin --> UC_Audit

DevOps --> UC_Metrics
DevOps --> UC_Kafka
DevOps --> UC_Discovery

UC_Kafka .> UC_Metrics : <<include>>
UC_Audit .> UC_Users : <<extend>>

@enduml

